**Fixing keyboard movement**

I see that the tap worked, but Shift+Right moved to the space after the block instead of the info. It seems like keyboard movement for non-TextBlock with the blockText path might be treating callouts as if they're not text. I need to fix the keyboard movement to properly support callout. I also want to inspect the horizontal key handling with P005 for "keyboard extension selection." I’ll use codegraph to help with this.
